  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan: Technical Assistance to Develop the Capacity of the Government on Immigration and Border Management.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of this project is to enhance Sudan&#x2019;s technical capacity to manage migration by improving border management processes and procedures, which will facilitate evidence-based programming on migration and support policy formation. The project builds the capacity within the Ministry of Interior by improving migration officers&#x2019; knowledge and technical skills on immigration and border management (IBM) related topics through a set of training targeting frontline, middle and senior level migration officers. The project will also enhance the Sudanese border management information system by an upgrade to the IOM developed Migration Information and Data Analysis System (MIDAS) for more effective data collection and analysis process at selected border posts.</narrative>
  </description>
